# Ignore rules for the Atlas Community image build. Paths are relative to the build context
# (this repository root — see Dockerfile). BuildKit reads this file because it is named
# "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" next to the Dockerfile.

# Build artefacts — never ship these into the build context.
**/bin
**/obj

# Local SQLite databases and their WAL/SHM sidecars.
**/atlas.db
**/atlas.db-shm
**/atlas.db-wal

# VCS, IDE and OS noise.
**/.git
**/.github
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store

# The Dockerfile copies only what it needs from this repository; keep noisy local artefacts
# out of the context so builds stay fast and reproducible.
